We hope you're enjoying Spotify. We've updated our Privacy Policy to provid=
e clearer language and more control over how your data powers your Spotify =
experience.=20


What=E2=80=99s New:


 <ul>
    <li>The updates increase the readability and transparency of our Privac=
y Policy.</li>
    <li>To that end, we've added additional information about how we collec=
t and use data to deliver new products or features.</li>
    <li>We've added details about the optional use of precise location data=
 to enhance your Spotify experience, including features like Concerts Near =
You and more relevant recommendations. This data is only collected if you o=
pt in through the app and your device settings. You can opt out at any time=
, and it is not shared with advertising partners.</li>
  </ul>


Please click here ( https://www.spotify.com/legal/privacy-policy-update/ ) =
to read the updated Privacy Policy, which will become effective on June 12,=
 2026.
If you have any questions, please visit our Privacy Center ( https://www.sp=
otify.com/privacy/ ) for more information and to contact us.=20



Thanks for using Spotify!



